    <guid isPermaLink="false">688b950fedf3fa32d580f737</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 16:34:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>❤好奇心是最大的礼物，解锁职业盲盒01——占星行业⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span>特此感谢嘉宾LYNN的倾情讲述，带我们了解了占星行业的一角，希望能够对想进入占星行业的朋友们有帮助~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔜 上期要点</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一层：行业好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1：基础科普篇：占星学是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 2：争议与真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二层：职场认知</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1：占星行业现状</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 2：行业基础知识篇</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>占星行业从业者可以从事哪些工作</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>占星师到底在做什么？具体工作内容有哪些</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><span>🔜 本期要点</span></p><span></span><h3><span>📝 占星编辑工作深挖</span></h3><span></span><p><span>🔧 核心工作内容</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三层：入行指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚪 入行门槛</span></p><span></span><p><span>💰 职业发展路径</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰ 关键时点导航 📍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a>：本期主题介绍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a>：嘉宾编辑工作经历（公众号选题、直播稿件撰写，水逆相关内容创作，编辑与作者分工）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a>：编辑工作细节（产出频率、团队构成、工作压力、行业内幕）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a>：行业从业者特点（心态平和、互相理解）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a>：普通人成为占星师的路径（明确目标、选择机构、学习实践、毕业认证）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2334">38:54</a>：占星行业其他职业路径（写作、翻译等）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2334">38:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a>：行业投入与学习深度（学费、学习内容难度）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">51:46</a>：占星学习中的特殊体验（观察太阳实践、感官与包容度变化）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">51:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a>：占星行业趋势（冥王星进入水瓶座对小众文化的影响）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3829">1:03:49</a>：行业认知与咨询案例（占星学的本质、印象深刻的客户咨询）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3829">1:03:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3993">1:06:33</a>：结尾</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📡 订阅（全网同名@FM树洞中转站，评论区开放职业故事投稿）</span></p>]]></description>
