  <item>
    <title>职业盲盒001-上：占星师——解读星盘的人，如何看透命运的剧本？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688a3b61edf3fa32d54ecef2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688a3b61edf3fa32d54ecef2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>❤好奇心是最大的礼物，解锁职业盲盒01——占星行业⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰ 关键时点导航 📍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 嘉宾简介：电气工程专业→伦敦占星学院认证占星师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 转行契机：童年《百变小樱》埋下神秘学种子 → 塔罗瓶颈 → 占星学重构理性与感性平衡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第一层：行业好奇心</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：基础科普篇：占星学是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>广泛定义，学科分类，不同国家占星学之间是否有区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 行业本质：占星=解读宇宙快照的"翻译学"（行星运动→人类活动映射）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 应用场景：情感咨询/金融占星/企业团队匹配 → 警惕99元速解骗局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 行业痛点：无国家认证标准 · 鱼龙混杂 · 成本趋近于零</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：争议与真相</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 科学性质疑："它是文化人类学意义上的社会科学，不是占卜水晶球"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 咨询哲学："是翻译官，不是预言家"（信息必有损耗，拒绝绝对化结论）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 硬核要求：出生时间精确到分钟（误差4分钟=星盘偏移1度！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 补救方案：生时校正→反推出生时间（但工作量巨大）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 预测逻辑：只能给"状态油画"，不给"事件数字"（例：婚姻危机≠必然离婚）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a> 自由意志论："灵魂强度决定你被命运牵引or驾驭命运"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3259">54:19</a> 从业者画像：运势写手（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3401">56:41</a>）· 平台咨询师 · 学术研究者（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3453">57:33</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第二层：职场认知</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：占星行业现状</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：行业基础知识篇</span></strong></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span>占星行业从业者可以从事哪些工作</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>占星师到底在做什么？具体工作内容有哪些</span></strong></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">1:06:00</a> 咨询全流程：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1️⃣ 客户填表（出生时间+模糊问题）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2️⃣ 占星师"灵魂附体式"备盘（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4211">1:10:11</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>3️⃣ 线下&gt;线上咨询（玄学加成：物理距离≈能量感应强度）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4️⃣ 复盘（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4412">1:13:32</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4604">1:16:44</a> 获客渠道</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🔜 下期预告</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>第三层：入行指南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>普通人如何成为占星师？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>入行门槛、薪资情况</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>职业发展路径</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第四层：一些有意思的问题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4747">1:19:07</a> → 公众号编辑生存实录｜占星写作黑话解剖｜零基础入行避雷手册</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎯 适合人群：想用玄学搞钱的内容创作者 · 神秘学行业观察者</span></p><span></span><p><span>📡 订阅戳这</span></p><span></span><p><span>（全网同名@</span><strong><span>FM树洞中转站</span></strong><span>，评论区开放职业故事投稿）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6275d0535b3a2748393b18c9/ligb7eAXssLMUnvDSNHlhg9KTjRW.m4a" length="115339857" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk831qfGCqklOjpEVxZys_bndxAY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>职场｜面对骗局如何按下暂停键</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681736ea47ebeede7eb3913e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681736ea47ebeede7eb3913e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 09:45:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【🎧VAMVAM的职场防诈指南】面试遇坑全记录+拆解术</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏰ 场景还原</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 开场：揭秘亲身经历的"高薪骗局"面试</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 灵魂拷问：选低底薪高提成？还是交钱当合伙人？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> 真相炸弹：两个都不选！当场识破套路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍 骗局拆解5步法</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 🚩 </span><strong><span>警惕单方面信息轰炸</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>面试官宣称"年入百万"却无法验证？冷处理+交叉验证才是王道</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>交叉验证法</span></em><span>：官网/企查查核实数据</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> 🧠 </span><strong><span>启动理性脑防御模式</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>看似正规的合同藏暗雷：利润不达标仅退初始资金</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>时间成本陷阱：两个月白干还要倒贴</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 📉 </span><strong><span>数据打假实操课</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>识破"50%利润率"话术：行业常识+反向思维破局</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>金句点醒："真赚钱的项目不会拉人分羹"</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 😶 </span><strong><span>表情管理必修技</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>骗子话术："你看起来很适合！现在签合同吧"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>防坑口诀：面无表情=自我保护盔甲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> ⏸️ </span><strong><span>按下暂停键话术</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>万能回应模板："我需要时间交叉验证贵司数据"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>反杀逻辑："好项目不怕晚两天签"</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 生存法则总结</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a> 防骗金句三连：</span><br><span>1️⃣ 天上掉的馅饼=地上挖的陷阱</span><br><span>2️⃣ 紧盯诱饵时=踏入圈套日</span><br><span>3️⃣ 普通人暴富梦≈骗子年终奖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📢 互动彩蛋</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 灵魂发问：你遇过哪些奇葩面试套路？评论区等你故事接龙！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（节目全长<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a>，防诈知识点密集覆盖，建议搭配茶水防气炸）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期shownotes由deepseek生成~</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：VAMVAM</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐：骗局 - CuZwhY</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Hidden Path (2024 Radio Edit) - Sleep Dealer</span></p>]]></description>
