  <item>
    <title>日常｜06.春困夏倦秋乏冬眠，为啥这么容易困？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647c0ca41672628240d2879f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647c0ca41672628240d2879f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jun 2023 04:01:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日常犯困时候引发的小疑惑，一年四困——春困夏倦秋乏冬眠，为啥这么容易困呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、犯困的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>①季节变换时身体需要时间适应；</span></p><span></span><p><span>②睡眠时间过长/过短，睡眠质量差；</span></p><span></span><p><span>③缺乏锻炼/不良饮食习惯；</span></p><span></span><p><span>④喝咖啡，身体缺水，宿醉；</span></p><span></span><p><span>⑤焦虑抑郁，心理压力大。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、改善犯困的小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>①经常锻炼；</span></p><span></span><p><span>②规律作息，保持充足睡眠；</span></p><span></span><p><span>③食物选择建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期资料来源于网络查阅，不作为具体参考依据，情形严重者建议就医；</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这期内容能对大家有所帮助~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lshp_gihzO8rv7Zrt_4-wyASrSkn.m4a" length="14397393" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:09:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvQllBOFZYNTJtdjVmZDF0MUc1WDVsQXY4NEoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
