  <item>
    <title>节日｜04.五一旅游狂潮，浅谈我的裸辞旅行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64520f9194d78eb3f7f80374</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64520f9194d78eb3f7f80374</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 07:38:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 前导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> &nbsp;今年五一旅游狂潮出现的一些现象</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.高铁票、机票、酒店民宿预定、景点门票三大劫；</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.大家选择错峰出行热门城市，依旧逃不开人群；</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.反向旅游冷门城市，结果是精准掉落在人堆；</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.五一最空的城市—“大学城”，五一最忙的兵种—特种兵；</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.本以为报团游能省事儿，结果事省了，一半时间花在了路上；6.“五一的堵，逐渐离谱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a>裸辞旅行准备阶段（时间、目的地、计划）</span></p><span></span><p><span>重庆4days-成都4days-乐山峨眉山-都江堰九寨沟黄龙景区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a>4天重庆旅行之中遇见的趣事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a>-青旅的常客发现，半夜她的床边出现了一双脚（补充：看监控明显能看出那个女生不是在梦游，那天她本来是该退房的，我出门前跟我说她要续住一晚，但我晚上回去老板说她并没有打电话和找他说。）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a>-4天成都之行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a>四川旅行景点分布，报团一些事儿；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a>乐山峨眉山，四天三座山，“特种兵”式旅行；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a>峨眉山的猴哥儿，关于抱小孩的姐姐被抢走奶瓶儿这件事儿；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a>都江堰-九寨沟-黄龙景区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a>关于我踩过的那些坑，避雷指南<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a>爬雪山的时候，得知我返杭航班取消班次，“十飞九黄”。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkEkhciR6j-Qp3p_oejF2NZKd2AZ.m4a" length="66761669" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:00</itunes:duration>
